#: apps/absences/models.py:317
msgid ""
"Only for a suspension that reduces the working day instead of stopping it. "
"Empty means the whole day. 40 means they still work 60 %."
msgstr ""
"Solo para una suspensión que reduce la jornada en vez de pararla. Vacío "
"significa el día entero. 40 significa que se sigue trabajando el 60 %."

