#: apps/absences/models.py:362
msgid ""
"Not available for sick leave: the medical certificate is not stored here. "
"Since RD 1060/2022 the worker no longer hands it to the employer --- the "
"INSS sends the data to the company directly."
msgstr ""
"No disponible en las bajas médicas: el parte no se guarda aquí. Desde el RD "
"1060/2022 el trabajador ya no lo entrega a la empresa: el INSS le remite los "
"datos directamente."

#: apps/absences/models.py:369
msgid "absence"
msgstr "ausencia"

#: apps/absences/models.py:370 apps/users/erase.py:80
msgid "absences"
msgstr "ausencias"

#: apps/absences/models.py:437 apps/absences/services.py:439
#: apps/common/rangos.py:80 apps/reports/views.py:100 apps/shifts/views.py:307
msgid "The end date cannot precede the start date."
msgstr "La fecha final no puede ir antes que la inicial."

#: apps/absences/models.py:443 apps/absences/views.py:373
msgid "Give both times, or neither: half of a range is not one."
msgstr "Pon las dos horas o ninguna: media franja no es una franja."

#: apps/absences/models.py:446 apps/users/serializers.py:491
msgid "It ends before it starts."
msgstr "Acaba antes de empezar."

#: apps/absences/models.py:451
msgid ""
"Part of a day is one day. For several days, leave the times empty and they "
"count whole."
msgstr ""
"Parte de un día es un día. Para varios días deja las horas vacías y cuentan "
"enteros."

#: apps/absences/models.py:463
msgid ""
"The medical certificate is not stored. Recording the absence, its dates and "
"its status is enough for working-time purposes, and since RD 1060/2022 the "
"worker does not hand the certificate to the employer: the INSS sends the "
"data to the company."
msgstr ""
"El parte de baja no se almacena. Para el control horario basta con registrar "
"la ausencia, sus fechas y su estado, y desde el RD 1060/2022 el trabajador "
"no entrega el parte a la empresa: se lo remite el INSS."

#: apps/absences/models.py:507
msgid "No deadline (art. 38.3, second paragraph)"
msgstr "Sin plazo (art. 38.3, párrafo segundo)"

#: apps/absences/models.py:508
msgid "Eighteen months (art. 38.3, third paragraph)"
msgstr "Dieciocho meses (art. 38.3, párrafo tercero)"

#: apps/absences/models.py:511
