msgid "That person is not in this company."
msgstr "Esa persona no pertenece a esta empresa."

#: apps/absences/views.py:469
msgid "Leave can only be requested for yourself."
msgstr "Solo puedes solicitar ausencias para ti."

#: apps/absences/views.py:479
msgid "That leave type does not exist or is no longer in use."
msgstr "Ese tipo de permiso no existe o ya no está en uso."

#: apps/absences/views.py:490
msgid ""
"This kind of leave is recorded by the company, not requested. Talk to "
"whoever manages your working time."
msgstr ""
"Este tipo de ausencia la registra la empresa, no se solicita. Habla con "
"quien gestione tu jornada."

#: apps/absences/views.py:674
msgid "You can only see your own balance."
msgstr "Solo puedes consultar tu propio saldo."

#: apps/absences/views.py:688
