#, python-format
msgid ""
"Averaging %(average)s h a day over %(days)s days. The roster reads like "
"night work, and if the status applies that is above the %(limit)s h of art. "
"36.1 ET."
msgstr ""
"Promedio de %(average)s h diarias en %(days)s días. El cuadrante se lee como "
"trabajo nocturno, y si le corresponde esa condición eso pasa de las "
"%(limit)s h del art. 36.1 ET."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:967
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(weeks)s consecutive weeks on the night shift, over the %(limit)s allowed. "
"More needs the person to have asked for it, which is a field on their record."
msgstr ""
"%(weeks)s semanas consecutivas en el turno de noche, por encima de las "
"%(limit)s permitidas. Para más hace falta que la persona se haya adscrito "
"voluntariamente, y eso es un campo de su ficha."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1008
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(hours)s h rostered for somebody under eighteen. The limit is %(limit)s h a "
"day and no agreement can raise it."
msgstr ""
"%(hours)s h planificadas a una persona menor de dieciocho años. El límite "
"son %(limit)s h diarias y ningún convenio puede subirlo."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1022
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A continuous day of %(hours)s h for somebody under eighteen needs a break of "
"%(minutes)s min, from %(after)s h."
msgstr ""
"Una jornada continuada de %(hours)s h de una persona menor de dieciocho años "
"necesita un descanso de %(minutes)s min, a partir de %(after)s h."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1040
msgid ""
"Night shift rostered for somebody under eighteen. Art. 6.2 ET forbids it "
"outright: there is no permitted amount."
msgstr ""
"Turno nocturno planificado a una persona menor de dieciocho años. El art. "
"6.2 ET lo prohíbe sin más: no hay cantidad permitida."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1129
msgid ""
"No contract start date, so the extra holiday the agreement gives for "
"seniority cannot be counted."
msgstr ""
"No consta la fecha de inicio del contrato, así que no se pueden contar los "
"días de vacaciones que el convenio da por antigüedad."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1186
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(given)s h a month of representation credit, and art. 68.e gives %(due)s h "
"for a workplace of %(people)s people."
msgstr ""
"%(given)s h al mes de crédito horario, y el art. 68.e da %(due)s h para un "
"centro de %(people)s personas."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1234
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The working day is cut by %(share)s %%, and art. 37.6 grants at least half "
"for the care of a seriously ill child."
msgstr ""
"La jornada se reduce un %(share)s %%, y el art. 37.6 concede al menos la "
"mitad para el cuidado de un menor con enfermedad grave."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1287
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(hours)s h of overtime to be given back as rest are past the %(days)s-day "
"deadline."
msgstr ""
"%(hours)s h de horas extraordinarias por devolver en descanso han pasado del "
"plazo de %(days)s días."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1393
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(hours)s h that week counting on-call time on the premises, over the "
"%(limit)s h maximum: a shift spent on call at the workplace is working time "
"in full."
msgstr ""
"%(hours)s h esa semana contando la guardia de presencia, por encima del "
"máximo de %(limit)s h: una guardia en el centro de trabajo es tiempo de "
"trabajo en su totalidad."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1480
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(hours)s h of on-call time that month, %(average)s h a week on average, "
"over the %(limit)s allowed."
msgstr ""
"%(hours)s h de tiempo de presencia ese mes, %(average)s h semanales de "
"promedio, por encima de las %(limit)s permitidas."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1531
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(hours)s h over the %(agreed)s h agreed for %(year)s, and art. 34.2 gives "
"%(months)s months to settle them."
msgstr ""
"%(hours)s h por encima de las %(agreed)s h pactadas para %(year)s, y el art. "
"34.2 da %(months)s meses para compensarlas."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1536
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(hours)s h under the %(agreed)s h agreed for %(year)s, and art. 34.2 gives "
"%(months)s months to settle them."
msgstr ""
"%(hours)s h por debajo de las %(agreed)s h pactadas para %(year)s, y el art. "
"34.2 da %(months)s meses para compensarlas."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1618
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The working day is cut by %(share)s %% for partial retirement, and art. 12.6 "
"runs from %(min)s %% to %(max)s %%."
msgstr ""
"La jornada se reduce un %(share)s %% por jubilación parcial, y el art. 12.6 "
"va del %(min)s %% al %(max)s %%."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1638
msgid ""
"This relief contract stands in for somebody with no partial retirement on "
"record, so there is nothing to measure it against."
msgstr ""
"Este contrato de relevo sustituye a alguien que no tiene jubilación parcial "
"registrada, así que no hay contra qué medirlo."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1662
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(hours)s h agreed, and art. 12.7 asks for at least %(needed)s: the hours "
"the person being relieved stops working."
msgstr ""
"%(hours)s h pactadas, y el art. 12.7 pide al menos %(needed)s: las horas que "
"deja de trabajar la persona relevada."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1709
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Asked for on %(day)s and still unanswered %(days)s days later: art. 34.8 "
"gives fifteen."
msgstr ""
"Solicitada el %(day)s y sin contestar %(days)s días después: el art. 34.8 da "
"quince."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1759
msgid ""
"This training contract does not say whether it is alternating (art. 11.2) or "
"for work practice (art. 11.3), and only the first one has a cap on working "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Este contrato formativo no dice si es en alternancia (art. 11.2) o para "
"práctica profesional (art. 11.3), y solo el primero tiene tope de jornada."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1790
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(agreed)s h agreed against a cap of %(cap)s: art. 11.2.b allows %(share)s "
"%% of the %(max)s h maximum working week."
msgstr ""
"%(agreed)s h pactadas contra un tope de %(cap)s: el art. 11.2.b permite el "
"%(share)s %% de las %(max)s h de jornada máxima."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1859
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(share)s %% of the time worked in the last three months was remote, over "
"the %(threshold)s %% that makes Law 10/2021 apply, and no agreement is on "
"record."
msgstr ""
"El %(share)s %% del tiempo trabajado en los últimos tres meses fue a "
"distancia, por encima del %(threshold)s %% que hace aplicable la Ley "
"10/2021, y no consta acuerdo."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1876
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The remote work agreement was signed on %(signed)s and the remote work began "
"on %(started)s."
msgstr ""
"El acuerdo de trabajo a distancia se firmó el %(signed)s y el trabajo a "
"distancia empezó el %(started)s."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1927
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The working day is cut by %(share)s %%, and art. 37.6 runs from an eighth to "
"a half --- between %(min)s %% and %(max)s %%."
msgstr ""
"La jornada se reduce un %(share)s %%, y el art. 37.6 va de un octavo a la "
"mitad: entre el %(min)s %% y el %(max)s %%."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1984
msgid "that week"
msgstr "esa semana"

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1985
msgid "that month"
msgstr "ese mes"

#: apps/shifts/services.py:1986
msgid "that year"
msgstr "ese año"

#: apps/shifts/services.py:2004
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(over)s h over the contract %(when)s, and only %(cap)s are allowed: "
"%(share)s %% of the %(agreed)s h agreed."
msgstr ""
"%(over)s h por encima del contrato %(when)s, y solo se permiten %(cap)s: el "
"%(share)s %% de las %(agreed)s h pactadas."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:2097
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(hours)s h actually worked that week, over the %(limit)s h maximum. This is "
"the record, not the roster."
msgstr ""
"%(hours)s h realmente trabajadas esa semana, por encima del máximo de "
"%(limit)s h. Esto es el registro, no el cuadrante."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:2110
#, python-format
msgid "%(hours)s h actually worked against %(agreed)s h contracted."
msgstr "%(hours)s h trabajadas de verdad frente a %(agreed)s h contratadas."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:2147
msgid "Rostered outside their periods of activity (art. 16 ET)."
msgstr "En el cuadrante fuera de sus periodos de actividad (art. 16 ET)."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:2149
msgid "Rostered on a day outside the dates of their contract."
msgstr "En el cuadrante un día fuera de las fechas de su contrato."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:2199
msgid ""
"Rostered on a public holiday. It is allowed, and it earns compensation in "
"rest or in pay under the agreement."
msgstr ""
"Planificado en un festivo. Está permitido, y genera compensación en descanso "
"o en dinero según el convenio."

#: apps/shifts/services.py:2238
#, python-format
msgid "Rostered on a day of approved %(kind)s."
msgstr "Con turno asignado en un día de %(kind)s aprobada."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:99
msgid "Pick at least one weekday, or leave the field out to mean every day."
msgstr ""
"Marca al menos un día de la semana, o no mandes el campo si quieres todos."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:146
msgid "Give a shift or its hours, not both: they would disagree."
msgstr "Indica un turno o sus horas, no las dos cosas: se contradirían."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:477
msgid "That person is not on the staff list."
msgstr "Esa persona no está en la plantilla."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:483
msgid "They already have a shift that day."
msgstr "Ya tiene un turno ese día."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:500
msgid "Shift covered by somebody else."
msgstr "Turno cubierto por otra persona."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:662
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The company works under %(regime)s, and RD 1561/1995 moves some of these "
"figures for that sector: check which article applies before reading this as "
"a mistake."
msgstr ""
"La empresa trabaja en régimen de %(regime)s, y el RD 1561/1995 aparta "
"algunas de estas cifras en ese sector: comprueba qué artículo aplica antes "
"de leerlo como un descuido."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:683
msgid ""
"With no days to answer, a change can be applied the moment it is proposed: "
"nobody gets the chance to agree or to disagree."
msgstr ""
"Sin días para responder, un cambio se puede aplicar en el momento en que se "
"propone: nadie llega a aceptarlo ni a discreparlo."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:705
#, python-format
msgid "%(value)s is below the %(floor)s that %(basis)s sets."
msgstr ""
"%(value)s queda por debajo de %(floor)s, que es lo que fija el %(basis)s."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:717
#, python-format
msgid "%(value)s is above the %(ceiling)s that %(basis)s sets."
msgstr "%(value)s pasa de %(ceiling)s, que es el tope que fija el %(basis)s."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:883
msgid ""
"Changing how time is counted needs the day it starts to apply. Without it "
"the change would reach periods already closed and reported."
msgstr ""
"Cambiar cómo se cuenta el tiempo exige decir desde qué día se aplica. Sin "
"eso, el cambio alcanzaría a periodos ya cerrados y entregados."

#: apps/shifts/views.py:916
msgid "How time was counted until this change."
msgstr "Cómo se contaba hasta este cambio."

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:131
msgid "the file does not contain a ficha"
msgstr "el fichero no contiene una ficha"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:140
msgid ""
"agreement.regcon: put it in quotes. Unquoted it is read as a number and a "
"code beginning with zero loses it"
msgstr ""
"agreement.regcon: ponlo entre comillas. Sin ellas se lee como número y un "
"código que empiece por cero lo pierde"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:158
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(keys)s: fixed and deferred at the same time; one of the two readings of "
"the agreement is wrong"
msgstr ""
"%(keys)s: fijado y delegado a la vez; una de las dos lecturas del convenio "
"está mal"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:241
msgid "dated in the future: nobody can have checked it yet"
msgstr "con fecha futura: nadie ha podido comprobarlo todavía"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:248
#, python-format
msgid "last checked on %(day)s, over two years ago"
msgstr "comprobado por última vez el %(day)s, hace más de dos años"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:260
#, python-format
msgid ""
"expired on %(day)s; a lapsed agreement that looks current is worse than no "
"ficha at all"
msgstr ""
"caducó el %(day)s; un convenio vencido que parece vigente es peor que no "
"tener ficha"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:269
msgid "earlier than valid_from"
msgstr "anterior a valid_from"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:280
#, python-format
msgid "%(got)s exceeds the legal maximum of 40"
msgstr "%(got)s pasa del máximo legal de 40"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:290
#, python-format
msgid "%(got)s is above the ceiling that 40 hours a week works out to (1826)"
msgstr "%(got)s pasa del techo al que equivalen 40 horas semanales (1826)"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:301
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(got)s exceeds nine ordinary hours; over that needs the agreement to "
"distribute the day irregularly, which is a company fact and not a property "
"of the agreement"
msgstr ""
"%(got)s pasa de nueve horas ordinarias; por encima hace falta pacto de "
"distribución irregular, que es un hecho de la empresa y no una propiedad del "
"convenio"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:316
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(got)s is below the twelve-hour floor. RD 1561/1995 lowers it for "
"particular sectors; if that is the case here, say so in the note"
msgstr ""
"%(got)s está por debajo del suelo de doce horas. El RD 1561/1995 lo rebaja "
"en sectores concretos; si es el caso, dilo en la nota"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:329
#, python-format
msgid "%(got)s is below a day and a half uninterrupted"
msgstr "%(got)s está por debajo de día y medio ininterrumpido"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:338
#, python-format
msgid "%(got)s exceeds the eighty-hour cap"
msgstr "%(got)s pasa del tope de ochenta horas"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:353
#, python-format
msgid "%(got)s %(unit)s is below the minimum of %(floor)s"
msgstr "%(got)s %(unit)s está por debajo del mínimo de %(floor)s"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:370
msgid "the break counts as working time but its length is not transcribed"
msgstr ""
"el descanso computa como trabajo efectivo pero no se transcribe su duración"

#: apps/tenants/agreements.py:390
#, python-format
msgid ""
"same code as %(other)s: the REGCON is what tells two similar agreements apart"
msgstr ""
"mismo código que %(other)s: el REGCON es lo que distingue dos convenios "
"parecidos"

