msgid ""
"Art. 34.2 ET, unless the collective agreement says otherwise. 0 turns it off."
msgstr ""

#: apps/tenants/rules.py:325
msgid "extra holiday by seniority"
msgstr "días de vacaciones por antigüedad"

#: apps/tenants/rules.py:330
msgid ""
"From the collective agreement, not the law. Empty means none: years of "
"service add nothing to the holiday allowance."
msgstr ""
"Del convenio, no de la ley. Vacío significa ninguno: los años de servicio no "
"suman nada al saldo de vacaciones."

#: apps/tenants/rules.py:350
msgid "night work is made up with"
msgstr "el trabajo nocturno se compensa con"

#: apps/tenants/rules.py:355 apps/tenants/rules.py:378
msgid "rest"
msgstr "descanso"

#: apps/tenants/rules.py:356
msgid "a specific payment"
msgstr ""

