#: apps/tenants/views.py:90
msgid ""
"Say which one: the agreement, or the decision and its date. A route with "
"nothing to check it against documents nothing."
msgstr ""
"Di cuál: el acuerdo, o la decisión y su fecha. Una vía sin nada contra lo "
